  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.1.0 — Multi-targeting .NET 10 and .NET 11\n\n**100% backwards compatible** — no public API or behavior change.\n\n- Adds a `lib/net11.0` asset next to `lib/net10.0`\n- `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer` is now referenced per target: 10.0.12 on `net10.0` (the unchanged floor) and 11.0.0 on `net11.0`, because each ASP.NET Core major ships for its own runtime\n- The metadata rate-limit guard uses `System.Threading.Lock` instead of `object` (cheaper enter/exit, same semantics)\n\nSee CHANGELOG.md and docs/ for full details.",
